<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Dabble — Revenue &amp; Growth Dashboard · Sep 1–6, 2026</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/chart.js@4.4.1/dist/chart.umd.min.js"></script>
<style>
:root{
  --canvas:#EDF1F5; --surface:#FFFFFF; --surface-2:#F7F9FB;
  --ink:#0D1B2A; --ink-2:#42566A; --ink-3:#75879A;
  --line:#DCE3EA; --line-2:#EBF0F4;
  --brand:#12496E; --brand-2:#1E6C9E; --brand-soft:#E8F1F7;
  --plan:#A9761B; --plan-soft:#FBF3E4;
  --pos:#0A7A48; --pos-soft:#E7F5ED;
  --neg:#B3261E; --neg-soft:#FCEBEA;
  --warn:#B4690E; --warn-soft:#FDF2E3;
  --void:#8C9AA8; --void-soft:#F0F2F4;
  --r:10px; --shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(13,27,42,.06), 0 1px 10px rgba(13,27,42,.04);
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%}
body{
  margin:0; background:var(--canvas); color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'Archivo',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;
  font-size:14px; line-height:1.5;
  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; font-feature-settings:"tnum" 1;
}
h1,h2,h3,h4{margin:0; font-weight:600; letter-spacing:-.015em}
p{margin:0}
button{font:inherit; color:inherit}
.wrap{max-width:1500px; margin:0 auto; padding:0 24px}

/* ---------- masthead ---------- */
.mast{background:var(--brand); color:#fff; padding:18px 0 16px}
.mast-in{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:20px; align-items:flex-end; justify-content:space-between}
.mast h1{font-size:20px; color:#fff; line-height:1.2}
.mast .sub{font-size:13px; color:#B9D3E5; margin-top:3px}
.mast-tools{display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:flex-end; flex-wrap:wrap}
.fld{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:5px}
.fld label{font-size:11px; color:#9FC3DA; letter-spacing:.02em}
.fld select{
  background:#0E3D5C; border:1px solid #24618A; color:#fff; border-radius:7px;
  padding:7px 10px; font-size:13px; min-width:104px; cursor:pointer;
}
.fld select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #8FC4E4; outline-offset:1px}
.rst{background:#0E3D5C; border:1px solid #24618A; color:#CFE4F1; border-radius:7px; padding:8px 12px; font-size:13px; cursor:pointer}
.rst:hover{background:#124B71}

/* ---------- tabs ---------- */
.tabs{position:sticky; top:0; z-index:60; background:var(--surface); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); box-shadow:0 1px 6px rgba(13,27,42,.05)}
.tabs-in{display:flex; gap:2px; overflow-x:auto; scrollbar-width:thin}
.tab{
  border:0; background:none; padding:14px 15px 12px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:500;
  color:var(--ink-2); border-bottom:2.5px solid transparent; cursor:pointer; white-space:nowrap;
}
.tab:hover{color:var(--ink); background:var(--surface-2)}
.tab[aria-selected="true"]{color:var(--brand); border-bottom-color:var(--brand); font-weight:600}
.tab .tnum{color:var(--ink-3); margin-right:7px; font-weight:400}
.tab[aria-selected="true"] .tnum{color:var(--brand-2)}

/* ---------- structure ---------- */
main{padding:22px 0 60px}
.panel[hidden]{display:none}
section.blk{margin-bottom:22px}
.blk-hd{margin-bottom:12px}
.blk-hd h2{font-size:16.5px}
.blk-hd .q{font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-3); margin-top:3px}
.card{background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r); box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.card-hd{padding:14px 16px 0}
.card-hd h3{font-size:14.5px}
.card-hd .q{font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-3); margin-top:2px}
.card-bd{padding:14px 16px 16px}
.grid{display:grid; gap:14px}
.g2{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
.g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}
.g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}
.span2{grid-column:span 2}

/* ---------- kpi ---------- */
.kpi{background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r); padding:13px 15px 14px; box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
.kpi .k-l{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-3); min-height:30px}
.kpi .k-v{font-size:26px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.03em; margin-top:5px; line-height:1.15}
.kpi .k-f{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-2); margin-top:5px}
.kpi.acc-pos{border-left:3px solid var(--pos)}
.kpi.acc-neg{border-left:3px solid var(--neg)}
.kpi.acc-warn{border-left:3px solid var(--warn)}
.kpi.acc-brand{border-left:3px solid var(--brand)}
.kpi.acc-plan{border-left:3px solid var(--plan)}
.kpi.acc-void{border-left:3px solid var(--void)}
.pos{color:var(--pos)} .neg{color:var(--neg)} .warn{color:var(--warn)} .muted{color:var(--ink-3)}

/* ---------- attainment hero ---------- */
.hero{background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r); box-shadow:var(--shadow); padding:20px 22px; margin-bottom:16px}
.hero-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:26px}
.att-name{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:baseline; gap:12px}
.att-name .n{font-size:14px; font-weight:600}
.att-name .n small{display:block; font-weight:400; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-3); margin-top:2px}
.att-name .pctv{font-size:30px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.03em; line-height:1}
.track{position:relative; height:34px; background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:6px; margin-top:12px; overflow:hidden}
.fillp{position:absolute; inset:0 auto 0 0; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#1B6494,#2C86BF)}
.fillp.over{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0A7A48,#17A05F)}
.planline{position:absolute; top:-4px; bottom:-4px; width:2px; background:var(--plan)}
.planflag{position:absolute; top:-19px; transform:translateX(-50%); font-size:10.5px; color:var(--plan); font-weight:600; white-space:nowrap}
.att-foot{display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:12px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-2); margin-top:18px}
.att-foot b{font-weight:600; color:var(--ink)}

/* ---------- callout / insight ---------- */
.callout{border-radius:var(--r); padding:14px 16px; font-size:13.5px; line-height:1.6}
.callout.brand{background:var(--brand-soft); border:1px solid #C7DEEC; color:#0C3A57}
.callout.warnc{background:var(--warn-soft); border:1px solid #F0D9B4; color:#7A470A}
.callout b{font-weight:600}
.ins-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr); gap:12px}
.ins{background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:var(--r); box-shadow:var(--shadow); overflow:hidden}
.ins summary{padding:13px 15px; cursor:pointer; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; list-style:none; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:10px; align-items:center}
.ins summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.ins summary .chev{color:var(--ink-3); font-size:12px; font-weight:400; transition:transform .18s ease}
.ins[open] summary .chev{transform:rotate(90deg)}
.ins summary:hover{background:var(--surface-2)}
.ins .body{padding:0 15px 14px; font-size:13px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.62}
.ins .body ul{margin:0; padding-left:17px}
.ins .body li{margin-bottom:6px}
.ins .body li:last-child{margin-bottom:0}
.ins .body b{color:var(--ink); font-weight:600}
.ins.t-pos{border-top:3px solid var(--pos)}
.ins.t-neg{border-top:3px solid var(--neg)}
.ins.t-warn{border-top:3px solid var(--warn)}
.ins.t-brand{border-top:3px solid var(--brand)}

/* ---------- tables ---------- */
.tbl-scroll{overflow-x:auto}
table{border-collapse:collapse; width:100%; font-size:12.5px}
th,td{padding:8px 10px; text-align:right; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2); white-space:nowrap}
th{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-3); font-weight:600; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); position:sticky; top:0; background:var(--surface); z-index:1}
td:first-child,th:first-child{text-align:left; font-weight:600}
tbody tr:hover td{background:var(--surface-2)}
tfoot td{font-weight:700; border-top:2px solid var(--line); border-bottom:0; background:var(--surface-2)}
.cell-hi{background:var(--pos-soft) !important; color:#075E38; font-weight:600}
.cell-lo{background:var(--neg-soft) !important; color:#8F1E17; font-weight:600}
.cell-mid{background:#FAFCF9}
.cell-na{background:var(--void-soft) !important; color:var(--void); font-style:italic}
.dayrow-best td:first-child{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--pos)}
.dayrow-worst td:first-child{box-shadow:inset 3px 0 0 var(--neg)}

/* ---------- chips / badges ---------- */
.chips{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:7px; align-items:center}
.chip{border:1px solid var(--line); background:var(--surface); border-radius:999px; padding:5px 12px; font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-2); cursor:pointer}
.chip:hover{border-color:var(--brand-2); color:var(--brand)}
.chip[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--brand); border-color:var(--brand); color:#fff; font-weight:500}
.chip:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--brand-2); outline-offset:1px}
.badge{display:inline-block; font-size:11px; font-weight:600; padding:2.5px 8px; border-radius:5px}
.b-pos{background:var(--pos-soft); color:var(--pos)}
.b-neg{background:var(--neg-soft); color:var(--neg)}
.b-warn{background:var(--warn-soft); color:var(--warn)}
.b-void{background:var(--void-soft); color:var(--void)}
.b-brand{background:var(--brand-soft); color:var(--brand)}

/* ---------- alerts ---------- */
.alert{display:grid; grid-template-columns:26px 1fr; gap:12px; padding:13px 15px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line-2)}
.alert:last-child{border-bottom:0}
.alert .dot{font-size:15px; line-height:1.4}
.alert .ttl{font-size:13.5px; font-weight:600; margin-bottom:3px}
.alert .dsc{font-size:12.8px; color:var(--ink-2); line-height:1.6}
.alert .dsc b{color:var(--ink)}
.alert .evd{font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-3); margin-top:4px}

/* ---------- charts ---------- */
.chart{position:relative; width:100%}
.h240{height:240px} .h280{height:280px} .h320{height:320px} .h360{height:360px}

/* ---------- funnel ---------- */
.funnel{display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:3px}
.fstep{position:relative; background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:7px; overflow:hidden}
.fbar{position:absolute; inset:0 auto 0 0; background:linear-gradient(90deg,#0E4166,#3B90C6)}
.fin{position:relative; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; padding:12px 14px; gap:12px}
.fin .fl{font-size:13px; font-weight:600}
.fin .fv{font-size:17px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.02em}
.fdrop{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:2px 14px; font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-3)}
.fdrop b{color:var(--ink-2); font-weight:600}

.mini{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:1px; background:var(--line-2); border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:8px; overflow:hidden}
.mini > div{background:var(--surface); padding:11px 13px}
.mini .m-l{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-3)}
.mini .m-v{font-size:18px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:-.02em; margin-top:3px}
.mini .m-f{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-2); margin-top:2px}

.note{font-size:11.8px; color:var(--ink-3); line-height:1.6; margin-top:10px}
.note b{color:var(--ink-2); font-weight:600}
.formula{font-size:11.5px; color:var(--ink-3); background:var(--surface-2); border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:6px; padding:8px 10px; line-height:1.7; margin-top:10px}
.formula span{color:var(--ink-2); font-weight:600}
.legend{display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:14px; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-2); margin-top:10px}
.legend i{display:inline-block; width:11px; height:11px; border-radius:3px; margin-right:6px; vertical-align:-1px}

footer{border-top:1px solid var(--line); padding:20px 0 40px; font-size:12px; color:var(--ink-3); line-height:1.7}
footer b{color:var(--ink-2)}

@media (max-width:1180px){
  .g4{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
  .g3{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media (max-width:920px){
  .wrap{padding:0 14px}
  .hero-grid,.g2,.g3,.g4,.ins-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .span2{grid-column:span 1}
  .mini{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none !important; animation:none !important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="mast">
  <div class="wrap mast-in">
    <div>
      <h1>Dabble — Revenue &amp; Growth Dashboard</h1>
      <p class="sub" id="periodSub">September 1–6, 2026 · Week 1 (partial week, 6 of 7 days)</p>
    </div>
    <div class="mast-tools">
      <div class="fld"><label for="dFrom">From</label><select id="dFrom"></select></div>
      <div class="fld"><label for="dTo">To</label><select id="dTo"></select></div>
      <button class="rst" id="btnReset" type="button">Reset to Sep 1–6</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="tabs" aria-label="Dashboard sections">
  <div class="wrap tabs-in" role="tablist">
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" data-p="p1"><span class="tnum">1</span>Executive overview</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p2"><span class="tnum">2</span>Target vs actual</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p3"><span class="tnum">3</span>Website funnel</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p4"><span class="tnum">4</span>Channel performance</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p5"><span class="tnum">5</span>Spend &amp; ROAS</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p6"><span class="tnum">6</span>Daily &amp; weekly trends</button>
    <button class="tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" data-p="p7"><span class="tnum">7</span>Insights &amp; actions</button>
  </div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<!-- ══════════ TAB 1 ══════════ -->
<div class="panel" id="p1" role="tabpanel">

  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-grid">
      <div>
        <div class="att-name">
          <div class="n">Dabble (own website)<small id="heroDabSub">Plan vs actual, cumulative</small></div>
          <div class="pctv" id="heroDabPct">—</div>
        </div>
        <div class="track"><div class="fillp" id="heroDabFill"></div><div class="planline" id="heroDabPlan"><span class="planflag">Plan</span></div></div>
        <div class="att-foot">
          <span>Plan <b id="heroDabPlanV">—</b></span>
          <span>Actual <b id="heroDabActV">—</b></span>
          <span>Variance <b id="heroDabVar">—</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="att-name">
          <div class="n">Dabble + 3P (total business)<small id="heroTotSub">Plan vs actual, cumulative</small></div>
          <div class="pctv" id="heroTotPct">—</div>
        </div>
        <div class="track"><div class="fillp" id="heroTotFill"></div><div class="planline" id="heroTotPlan"><span class="planflag">Plan</span></div></div>
        <div class="att-foot">
          <span>Plan <b id="heroTotPlanV">—</b></span>
          <span>Actual <b id="heroTotActV">—</b></span>
          <span>Variance <b id="heroTotVar">—</b></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="callout brand" id="heroRead" style="margin-top:20px"></div>
  </div>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Business scorecard</h2><p class="q">Where are we against plan, and what is each part of the business contributing?</p></div>
    <div class="grid g4" id="kpiRow1"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="grid g4" id="kpiRow2"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>What the numbers say</h2><p class="q">The five things a CEO should take from this period.</p></div>
    <div class="ins-grid" id="topInsights"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-hd"><h3>Attainment by day</h3><p class="q">Which days carried the period, and which fell short?</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="chart h280"><canvas id="cAchDaily"></canvas></div>
          <div class="note">The 100% line is plan. Dabble clears it on 4 of 6 days; total business clears it on 2.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-hd"><h3>Where GMV comes from</h3><p class="q">How concentrated is revenue across channels?</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="chart h280"><canvas id="cMix"></canvas></div>
          <div class="note">Share of reconciled Dabble + 3P GMV. BIK sits inside website GMV and is not added again.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ══════════ TAB 2 ══════════ -->
<div class="panel" id="p2" role="tabpanel" hidden>
  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Cumulative target vs actual</h2><p class="q">Is the beat coming from our own website or from marketplaces?</p></div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-bd"><div class="chart h320"><canvas id="cTvA"></canvas></div></div></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-hd"><h3>The split behind the headline</h3><p class="q">3P is derived as Dabble + 3P minus Dabble.</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="tbl-scroll"><table id="tSplit"></table></div>
          <div class="formula">Achievement % = <span>Actual ÷ Plan</span> · Variance ₹ = <span>Actual − Plan</span> · 3P = <span>(Dabble+3P) − Dabble</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Daily target vs actual</h2><p class="q">Plan, actual, achievement and rupee variance for every day.</p></div>
    <div class="card"><div class="card-bd">
      <div class="chart h320"><canvas id="cTvADaily"></canvas></div>
      <div class="tbl-scroll" style="margin-top:16px"><table id="tTvADaily"></table></div>
    </div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Day-level diagnosis</h2><p class="q">Strongest and weakest days, and how much rests on one of them.</p></div>
    <div class="grid g4" id="diagCards"></div>
    <div class="card" style="margin-top:14px"><div class="card-hd"><h3>Why Sep 6 matters more than its rank</h3><p class="q">Separating what happened from what it means.</p></div>
      <div class="card-bd" id="sep6Box"></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

<!-- ══════════ TAB 3 ══════════ -->
<div class="panel" id="p3" role="tabpanel" hidden>
  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Website funnel</h2><p class="q">Traffic → add to cart → orders → GMV, for the selected period.</p></div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-bd"><div class="funnel" id="funnelBox"></div>
        <div class="formula">ATC rate = <span>ATC ÷ Traffic</span> · Conversion = <span>Orders ÷ Traffic</span> · Cart-to-order = <span>Orders ÷ ATC</span> · AOV = <span>GMV ÷ Orders</span> · Revenue per visitor = <span>GMV ÷ Traffic</span></div>
      </div></div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-hd"><h3>Funnel rates</h3><p class="q">Recomputed from raw counts, not taken from the sheet.</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="mini" id="funnelMini"></div>
          <div class="chart h240" style="margin-top:14px"><canvas id="cFunnelRates"></canvas></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-hd"><h3>Daily funnel trend</h3><p class="q">Is GMV moving because of traffic, conversion, or basket size?</p></div>
      <div class="card-bd">
        <div class="chips" id="funnelToggle" style="margin-bottom:12px"></div>
        <div class="chart h320"><canvas id="cFunnelDaily"></canvas></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Funnel diagnosis</h2><p class="q">What moved, and what the available data can and cannot attribute it to.</p></div>
    <div class="ins-grid" id="funnelDiag"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
    <div class="blk-hd"><h2>Returning vs new customers</h2><p class="q">Are we growing on repeat demand or on acquisition?</p></div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="card"><div class="card-hd"><h3>Segment comparison</h3><p class="q">Traffic, conversion, orders and basket size side by side.</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="tbl-scroll"><table id="tRbNb"></table></div>
          <div class="note" id="rbnbNote"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="card"><div class="card-hd"><h3>Conversion and basket by segment</h3><p class="q">Repeat buyers convert better; new buyers spend more per order.</p></div>
        <div class="card-bd"><div class="chart h280"><canvas id="cRbNb"></canvas></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="blk">
