    "Blended ROAS softened from <b>"+rx(aFirst.amzTot/aFirst.amzSp)+"</b> to <b>"+rx(aLast.amzTot/aLast.amzSp)+"</b> — the weakest reading of the period on the last day. "+
    "Direction is up but volatile: day-over-day moves range from <b>"+pctp(Math.min(...rows.slice(1).map((r,i)=>(r.amzTot-rows[i].amzTot)/rows[i].amzTot)),1)+"</b> to <b>"+pctp(Math.max(...rows.slice(1).map((r,i)=>(r.amzTot-rows[i].amzTot)/rows[i].amzTot)),1)+"</b>. "+
